    rdfs:label "ONDA & FLATLAND | Research Storytelling Canvas" ;
    ns5:ARG_2000028 <http://openvivo.org/a/doi10.6084/m9.figshare.3179875-vcard> ;
    ns5:RO_0002353 <http://openvivo.org/a/eventFORCE2016> ;
    ns3:abstract """Together with Flatland, OndaPolitica has been developing tools to help scientists 
communicate research for a broader audience. 

One of those tools is the Research Dissemination Canvas. This canvas was
 inspired in the Business Model Canvas, a collaborative method put out 
to help entrepreneurs structuring business ideas. In order to design it,
 we have applied the same logic but translated it to research 
communication. <br>""" ;
