    rdfs:label "Classifying Interdisciplinary Research in Scholars@TAMU" ;
    ns3:abstract "Texas A&amp;M University (TAMU) recently identified six interdisciplinary and societally-relevant research themes as strengths of the institution that address societal grand challenges.<br>TAMU Libraries are interested in adapting and extending the VIVO ontology in order to create a dashboard that represents research products (i.e., manuscripts and grants), accomplishments, and the communities addressing each of these themes.<br>This would support and demonstrate TAMU’s societal impact.<br>This poster presents a plan for the experimental classification of multidisciplinary research studies." ;
    ns3:doi "10.6084/m9.figshare.3644991.v1" ;
