    ns3:abstract "VIVO for Historical Persons (VIVO4HP) is an experiment to re-use and extend the OpenRIF VIVO-ISF ontology to accommodate historical persons, using early Stuart diplomats (1603-1649) as a use case. These slides are from our team's VIVO 2016 Featured Presentation." ;
