        <http://openvivo.org/a/n53525>,
        <http://openvivo.org/a/n79093>,
        <http://openvivo.org/a/n8532> .

<http://openvivo.org/a/doi10.11648/j.ajbio.20150306.20> a ns5:BFO_0000001,
