        <http://openvivo.org/a/n46593>,
        <http://openvivo.org/a/n58565>,
        <http://openvivo.org/a/n59563> .

<http://openvivo.org/a/doi10.11648/j.ijnfs.20150406.20> a ns5:BFO_0000001,
        ns5:BFO_0000002,
