        <http://openvivo.org/a/n41529>,
        <http://openvivo.org/a/n57231>,
        <http://openvivo.org/a/n8374> .

<http://openvivo.org/a/doi10.11648/j.sjac.20150306.11> a ns5:BFO_0000001,
        ns5:BFO_0000002,
