        <http://openvivo.org/a/n25334>,
        <http://openvivo.org/a/n31041>,
        <http://openvivo.org/a/n51728> .

<http://openvivo.org/a/doi10.11648/j.sjac.20170502.11> a ns5:BFO_0000001,
        ns5:BFO_0000002,
