        <http://openvivo.org/a/n53234>,
        <http://openvivo.org/a/n55141>,
        <http://openvivo.org/a/n84769> .

<http://openvivo.org/a/doi10.11648/j.sjc.20150306.11> a ns5:BFO_0000001,
        ns5:BFO_0000002,
