    ns1:overview "As Director of Information Technology Services for the University Libraries at Virginia Tech, Bill is responsible for the planning and management of the department&rsquo;s activities and employees, and provides leadership and expertise in strategic technology management to enhance the growth and effectiveness of the Libraries&rsquo; services. Bill holds an MS from the iSchool at Illinois, a BA from the University of Virginia, and is currently pursuing a PhD in Computer Science from Virginia Tech." ;
