    rdfs:label "Introduction to VIVO: VIVO 2016 Conference Workshop" ;
    ns5:ARG_2000028 <http://openvivo.org/a/doi10.6084/m9.figshare.3749682-vcard> ;
    ns5:RO_0002353 <http://openvivo.org/a/eventVIVO2016> ;
    ns3:abstract "<p>This VIVO 2016 conference workshop provided an institutional perspective from a group of community members who have worked with VIVO at different institutions. The presenters addressed how VIVO was used in their organizations, where the data comes from, how VIVO is managed, and how to feed downstream systems. Also how to find the right resources as a new VIVO implementation — data sources, team members, governance models, and support structures. This workshop brings best practices and “lessons learned” from mature VIVO projects to new implementations.</p>" ;
    ns3:doi "10.6084/m9.figshare.3749682" ;
