    ns3:abstract "Slides for opening of the openRIF workshop at Force2016. <div>There exists an ecosystem of different projects that aim to represent the different aspects of the research ecosystem. OpenRIF aims to bring these efforts together to help support interoperability, improved attribution, and use of research data for analytics and team science.</div>" ;
