    ns1:overview "Director of the Harvard Office for Scholarly Communication, Director of the Harvard Open Access Project, Senior Researcher at the Berkman Center for Internet &amp; Society, and Senior Researcher at the Scholarly Publishing and Academic Resources Coalition. I do not currently display ORCID's list of my publications. But the only reason is that ORCID's list is incomplete, and I maintain a complete list at my home page. For more, see my home page &lt;bit.ly/petersuber&gt;." ;
