    ns1:orcidId <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-0552-1094> ;
    ns1:overview "Ronald Jantz is the Digital Library Architect in the Scholarly Communication Center of Rutgers University Libraries.  He received his PhD from Rutgers’ School of Communication and Information in 2013 and he also holds a Master’s degree in Mathematics and a Master’s degree in Library Science.  His research interests relate to organizational innovation in non-profit organizations with a specific focus on research libraries and how these institutions are using technology to innovate.  Recent publications have appeared in Library & Information Science Research and College & Research Libraries."^^xsd:string ;
