    ns1:orcidId <http://orcid.org/0000-0001-8994-163X> ;
    ns1:overview """Dong Joon Lee:  I am an assistant professor and researcher information systems librarian at the Office of Scholarly Communications, Texas A&M University Libraries. I earned my PhD in Information Studies from School of Information, Florida State University and hold a MS in Information Management from University of Washington iSchool, and a BS in Computer Information Systems from Grove City College.

My areas of research interests are scholarly communications, researcher identity management systems, data curation, and institutional repositories."""^^xsd:string ;
