    ns1:overview "Working as Senior Scientist (Plant Physiology) in the Agricultural Research Service of the Indian Council of Agricultural Research (ICAR). Currently posted at ICAR-Indian Institute of Horticultural Research (IIHR), Bengaluru in the division of ICAR-All India Coordinated Research Project on Fruits.. Apart from interests in Plant Physiology and Plant Phenology of fruit trees, I have interests in Open Science and Open Access to public funded research. I am also volunteering as Convenor of the Open Access India, a community of practice advocating Open Access, Open Data and Open Education in India."^^xsd:string ;
