    ns1:overview "Director of Repository Development at Cornell University Library. Current research interests are in web information systems, interoperability and open-access scholarly publishing. Current projects include Linked Data for Libraries (LD4L), the arXiv e-print archive, Cornell University Library archival repository (CULAR), IIIF, ResourceSync and ORCID."^^xsd:string ;
