    ns1:orcidId <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-7417-7373> ;
    ns1:overview "Adrian K. Ho is Director of Digital Scholarship at the University of Kentucky (UK) Libraries. He manages UKnowledge (http://uknowledge.uky.edu/), UK's institutional repository that collects, organizes, archives, and provides worldwide access to UK’s intellectual capital. He explores opportunities to collaborate with UK faculty members and students to maximize access to their research and scholarship through UKnowledge so that people around the world will benefit from the UK community's academic outputs. Adrian also makes an effort to raise awareness of scholarly communication issues such as open access, author rights, and data management. Adrian has worked in collection development and public services at different institutions in the U.S. and Canada.  "^^xsd:string ;
