    ns1:overview "&nbsp;A Molecular Biologist &amp; Biochemist by training, I slowly grew into project management and strategy in Industry and Higher Education. I currently head the Research Information team at the Research Strategy Office with responsibilities for managing and implementing software tools for Academics and Administrators (Symplectic, Altmetric, Dimensions, Research Professional, ORCID and VIVO) and provision of analysis (including network and collaboration analysis) for Collegiate Cambridge." ;
