    ns1:overview "Dahryn Trivedi is the wife of Mahendra Kumar Trivedi and assists in running a multi-million-dollar company Trivedi Global, Inc. Dahryn knew she was born for a higher purpose and began her journey to the Divine from a young age. She became a black-belt in Karate and was a Dean&rsquo;s List, A-Level student.The moment Dahryn met &ldquo;Guruji&rdquo; Mahendra Trivedi, she could see this great Master embodied the miraculous Divine Consciousness. Mr. Trivedi has the unique ability to harness the energy from the universe and transmit it to living organisms or nonliving materials anywhere in the world. The energy performs intelligently and beneficially to the recipient&rsquo;s unique needs, optimizing the recipient&rsquo;s potential thus altering their behaviors and characteristics.This unique phenomenon is world renowned as the Trivedi Effect&reg; with over 4,000 scientific studies in human health, cancer, microbiology, genetics, livestock, agriculture, biotechnology and materials science. Over a quarter-million people&rsquo;s lives have been transformed, demonstrating the Trivedi Effect&reg;&rsquo;s power to uplift every aspect of the human condition. Dahryn immediately knew this was her destiny. Dahryn has since accomplished much to assist Guruji and his life-changing work,while travelling the globe with him. At 21, Dahryn launchedher first company featuring an energy-infused skincare product reputed for beneficially impacting every aspect of a person&rsquo;s life. In March 2012, Dahryn became a Spiritual Master, gifted with the Divine Consciousness to transmit Divine Energy to others. She has coauthored with Guruji in over 150 international peer-reviewed science publications on the capabilities of the Trivedi Effect&reg;." ;
