    ns1:orcidId <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-3363-3520> ;
    ns1:overview """<p>Alice Branton received her MBA from the Bentley College Graduate School of Business in 2001, with Distinction, and has since served in top executive positions in dynamic, growing companies. Her keen sense of strategic development in finance, marketing, technology, operations and consumer relations has produced a reputation for driving results. In June 2016, she became a member of the American Chemical Society.</p>\r
<p>Alice Branton is a natural healer by birth. From a young age, she was aware of the influence of higher consciousness on human potential. Her desire to develop her gifts led her to work with some of America&rsquo;s top transformational leaders and Energy Healers. Her studies included personal development, leadership coaching, life coaching, mindset coaching, nutrition, as well as creating a leadership education company for kids. Through her efforts, she learned that mind/body conditioning has its limitations and that true transformation could not be realized through tricks and techniques alone. She continued to seek a genuine catalyst of transformation with the inherent gift to optimize the unlimited potential of humanity beyond the world&rsquo;s current understanding.</p>\r
<p>In October 2010, Alice was first introduced to Guruji Mahendra Trivedi and the Trivedi Effect&reg; remotely through a live webcast. The next day, Alice awoke feeling refreshed and rejuvenated during a challenging time of personal stress. She discovered that her chronic, severe sciatic nerve pain had disappeared permanently.</p>\r
<p>Mahendra Kumar Trivedi has the unique ability to harness the energy from the universe and transmit it to living organisms or nonliving materials anywhere in the world. The energy performs intelligently and beneficially to the recipient&rsquo;s unique needs, optimizing the recipient&rsquo;s potential at the cellular, molecular and atomic level, thus leading to lasting changes in their behaviors and characteristics. This unique phenomenon has become world renowned as the Trivedi Effect&reg;.</p>\r
<p>Alice was drawn to the Trivedi Effect&reg;&rsquo;s ability to transform and elevate her own human experience; and the documented scientific experiments on the Trivedi Effect&reg; gave her confidence that this was the authentic means for transformation that she had been seeking.</p>\r
<p>A personal visit from Mahendra Trivedi in November 2010 set her life on a new course. Later that year, Alice joined the Trivedi Organization and in February 2012, she was promoted to CEO of Trivedi Global, Inc. Through her association with Mr. Trivedi and his guidance, she became a Spiritual Master on November 9th, 2013, with fully developed powers to harness and transmit the intelligent energy of the Trivedi Effect&reg;.</p>\r
<p>Research</p>\r
<p>Alice Branton has co-authored with Mahendra Trivedi in over 150 international peer-reviewed science publications on the capabilities of the Trivedi Effect&reg; to transform living organisms and non-living materials. These publications have been adopted by the National Institutes of Health, over 900 universities within the U.S. and hundreds more internationally, including Oxford, Cambridge, Princeton, Harvard, Colombia, Brown, Dartmouth, Penn State, Cornell and Yale. Her biofield energy treatments have benefited many people and the count of positive testimonials is growing. As a Spiritual Master, Alice is fulfilling and extending the work of Mahendra Trivedi.</p>\r
<p>As the CEO of Trivedi Global, Inc., Alice Branton has been in close communication with the increasing number of people who have participated in &ldquo;Trivedi Master Wellness&rdquo; Programs, which were designed so people could access firsthand the energy that powers the Trivedi Effect&reg;. The reports have been described as &ldquo;life-changing&rdquo; and &ldquo;miraculous,&rdquo; with people claiming that the Energy Transmissions have brought about relief from debilitating illnesses, diseases and disorders such as sleep disorders, insomnia, sleep apnea, fatigue, chronic fatigue syndrome, irritable bowel syndrome (IBS), attention deficit disorder (ADD), attention deficit hyperactive disorder (ADHD), fibromyalgia, arthritis, chronic pain, muscle pain, joint pain, low libido, sexual impotency, erectile dysfunction, sexual dysfunction, premenstrual syndrome (PMS), severe migraines, low energy and more. Others insist having improved immune systems and greater self-healing abilities, including those suffering from cancer and those who have received chemotherapy and radiation treatments.</p>\r
<p>People have also noted significant improvements in their emotional and mental wellbeing, including neurological disorders, psychological disorders, psychosomatic disorders, sadness, depression, fear, bipolar disorder, emotional trauma, post-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD), obsessive compulsive disorder (OCD), stress, anxiety, separation anxiety, social anxiety disorder, other anxiety disorders, panic attacks and panic disorders, anorexia nervosa, anorexia bulimia, low self-esteem, loneliness, uncertainty, worry, mood swings, indecisiveness; feelings of restlessness, dissatisfaction, boredom, hopelessness and worthlessness. Parents with children who have Autism Spectrum Disorders have observed visible and dramatic shifts in their children&rsquo;s mood, social interaction, awareness, environmental integration, behavior, and mental and emotional wellbeing,</p>\r
<p>Furthermore, people consistently report feeling greater calmness, happiness, compassion, love, affection, indescribable peace, empathy, inspiration, motivation, spirituality, intuition, self-esteem, intelligence, intellectuality, pleasure, sexual orgasm and ejaculation, deeper relationships, enthusiasm, altered perceptions and a love of life.</p>\r
<p>Mr. Trivedi has no religious affiliation and does not endorse any healing modality, recommending everyone follow their own beliefs and inner guidance. However, some report the Trivedi Effect&reg; has deepened their religious faiths (Christianity, Catholicism, Protestant, Baptist, Judaism, Scientology, Hinduism and Buddhism). By entering into higher levels of consciousness through the Energy Transmissions, people insist having experienced Spiritual Awakenings, more profound experiences during spiritual practices such as yoga, meditation and mindfulness, and greater progress along their Spiritual Journey.</p>\r
<p>Additionally, many people claim they have discovered their life&rsquo;s purpose and feel more deeply connected to Nature, Spirit and their souls. Others find their capabilities as healers in areas like Integrative Medicine, Holistic Medicine, Functional Medicine, Energy Medicine, Energy Healing, Healing Touch, Tai Chi, Reiki, Qi Gong and other alternative and complementary medicine modalities, has heightened.</p>\r
<p>Despite the increasing number of over 250,000 individuals who attest to beneficial results in physical health, sexual satisfaction, relationships, emotional health, mental potency, business ventures, finances and much more, Mr. Trivedi was aware of the possibility of the placebo effect. Thus, he sought to evaluate authenticity of the Trivedi Effect&reg; through rigorous, scientific application.</p>\r
<p>Mr. Trivedi created an invaluable database on the power of consciousness and human potential, with over 4,000 scientific studies conducted on the Trivedi Effect&reg; in agriculture, livestock, biotechnology, microbiology, genetics, human health, cancer and materials science. Furthermore, nearly 200 papers have been published in leading international peer-reviewed scientific journals documenting measured results of the Trivedi Effect&reg;, thus excluding the possibility of the placebo effect.</p>\r
<p>Astounding results have led to collaborations with leading scientists such as Dr. Rustom Roy, a materials scientist from Penn State University who was nominated for the Nobel Prize 23 times. Through his corroboration with Guruji Mahendra Trivedi, Dr. Roy predicted that Mr. Trivedi&rsquo;s science research would trigger the upstart of a new scientific paradigm of understanding. He had this to say about Mr. Trivedi and his abilities, &ldquo;I see him as the completion of what India has brought to the world in modern scientific terms. &hellip; Science is the religion of the world. It&rsquo;s going to be very tough for the establishment to hold onto old ideas. I think with Mr. Trivedi's potential, he may become a pioneer in loosening the grasp of old science... I have no doubt Mr. Trivedi will change the face of science and human well-being in my lifetime.&rdquo;</p>\r
<p>Mr. Trivedi and Alice Branton have developed more than 100 Biofield Energy Healers throughout the world whose abilities have been scientifically tested, measured, documented and published in international, peer-reviewed science journals. This research shows promise for people suffering from autoimmune disorders like Addison&rsquo;s disease, Alopecia, Autoimmune hepatitis, Celiac disease (gluten sensitivity), Crohn&rsquo;s disease, Dermatitis, Endometriosis, Graves&rsquo; disease, Guillain-Barre syndrome, Hashimoto&rsquo;s thyroiditis, Interstitial cystitis (IC), Lupus, Lyme disease, Multiple sclerosis (MS), Psoriasis, Rheumatoid arthritis (RA), Type 1 diabetes, Ulcerative colitis (UC) and Vitiligo, as well as for inflammatory diseases like Allergies, Alzheimer&rsquo;s, Asthma, Eczema, Pancreatitis, Acid Reflux, Heart Disease and high blood pressure.</p>\r
<p>Although it seems clear that the Trivedi Effect&reg; energy has some sort of inherent intelligence that is capable of distinguishing and treating each recipient uniquely, a study conducted to assess the Trivedi Effect&reg; biofield energy treatments on a mixed sample of cancerous and noncancerous cells at the California Pacific Medical Center Research Institute provides undeniable support to this theory:</p>\r
<p>&ldquo;The results suggest that the biofield treatment administered in the laboratory can induce cell death of brain cancer cells from a distance while at the same time promoting viability of normal brain cells. Such selective efficacy against cancer cells is the sought after &lsquo;holy grail&rsquo; for novel experimental anti-cancer agents and makes this work all the more exciting.&rdquo;</p>\r
<p>Garrett L. Yount, Ph.D.</p>\r
<p>The Trivedi mission statement is to utilize the Trivedi Effect&reg; to usher in a new era that integrates scientific research with consciousness to vastly improve the human condition and benefit humanity on a global scale. Currently, Ms. Branton and Mr. Trivedi are continuing their investigation of the energy that powers the Trivedi Effect&reg; via collaboration with an international, multi-billion-dollar research organization to study the impact of the Trivedi Effect&reg; on revolutionary pharmaceutical and nutraceutical products with great promise for the treatment of immune disorders, inflammatory diseases, cancer and obesity; as well as for anti-aging, antioxidants, probiotics, prebiotics and overall health for the betterment of the world.</p>""" ;
